    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "brendan Martel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112043011856875361741/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJtfcYqritlINwt9oUq_uKrlQZoIuwcX-nyDv0uHSY5_HyC7Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Had my tires done today and they got done very quickly. The price is a lot better than other garages in the area. All in all a very positive experience",
        "time": 1762882367,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Eric",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104498424660183582615/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVfAMhkiOnsCmrkmQYYliG72TJXSSx1gvKNA-dw3Rk7fzDhOU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "A true 5 star garage.\n\nI should have written a review many moons ago, but due to lack of time I didn’t.\n\nA good mechanic is like a good dentist. You never really know what they do, some are honest and others not so much.\n\nMax is that honest guy and to top it off he has a great heart. My 18 year old daughter bought a used car, and it was a mess. A real mess. Max as always gave us an honest assessment. It was too expensive for our daughter.\n\nMax called a day later and took most of the labour costs off because he didn’t want her to drive her car as it was.\n\nIf you want an honest and great mechanic that will go out of his way to help you, you found him!!!",
        "time": 1720962100,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "M Sauve",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115447790419722572586/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwg3yub-SmlscjRQRIQM9i5U6HEfCDKLFWowUKXmv7B3cA7g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Honestly the best service with Max! Very honest with the prices and will try to find the best alternatives for better prices. He also made me realize I was getting ripped off by my other garage. 100% recommend",
        "time": 1749297137,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nikhil Nair",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108945909182934941253/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUZPktfOe46wA2lsAkmqRkk-c_aeWJVL7VOqAFeDFrChaNHKAotHA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "It’s a tiny shop but with a lot of expertise and experience. They’ll handle anything from mundane oil and tire changes, new tires to full on engine swaps and everything in between (including brake, etc). It’s a no-nonsense and more importantly, no bullshit and no imaginary markup mechanic shop - a rarity these days. Highly recommend. Bring the guys a donut and your car will probably leave the shop with an extra 12 hp.",
        "time": 1739227254,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Vincent Lessard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117111905632722174206/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJf1uR1lRRf-tYPdyjRJCAheSt3iwb5RW3P4kINFHK00W_u_oY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Great, professional and timely service. Even recommended I go to the dealership for a set of shocks he noticed were leaking that likely still under warranty. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1749498165,
        "translated": false
      }
